  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming global economic systems for rights-based economies 2020-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build on our successful partnership with CESR to promote a human rights approach to development, including economic justice. In particular, we will continue to work with them to emphasise the importance of addressing economic inequality to deliver the SDGs and to promote a human rights approach to tax. Whilst this is a core grant supporting a lot of their US-based advocacy (to the UN and to Washington-based institutions), we will also seek to maximise collaboration through publications, panel events through CA and CA Ireland.</narrative>
  </description>
